
~ start

PLUM: It's a bit high for me to reach (thinking)

- Turn on the sink
	Nothing came out
	PLUM: All that struggle for nothing... (embarassed)
	=> END

- Open the drawer
	match get_choice_count("alcohol_taken")
		when 0
			There's rubbing alcohol in it.

			- Take it
				PLUM: Dad will love this. (sad)
				PLUM: I'll take for him.
				$> GameState.add_item("Rubbing Alcohol")
				$> increment_choice("alcohol_taken")
				=> END

			- Drink it
				PLUM: My dad drinks this stuff all the time. (Silly)
				PLUM: My mouth feels weird. (sad)
				Your stomach starts hurting badly.
				PLUM: Ow. (Sad)
				PLUM: Dad said to always throw it up. (thinking)
				You throw it up. It feels even worse.
				You don't have any energy to move.
				You take a nap.
				[scene=game_over]
				=> END

		else
			just a few webs...
			=> END
